  annote  = {The honest source for what the auxiliary-function bound cannot do, which is
             what Paper 1's limitations section needs. Section 2.3.1 p1834 with
             Thm 2.5 p1835: for ODEs on a FINITE time horizon the optimal bound
             over local auxiliary functions is SHARP --- so any looseness Paper 1
