             true value. Section 2.2 p1832 global versus local auxiliary
             functions, the same distinction Paper 1 draws between a corridor-wide
             and a phase-wise certificate. Section 3 pp1838-1840 recovers optimal
             TRAJECTORIES from near-optimal auxiliary functions --- the natural
             cross-check that a computed bound is attained, and cheaper than
             re-solving. Thm 4.1 p1842 the SOS formulation, and note its
             hypothesis that the set definitions include explicit ball
             constraints C1 - t^2 - |x|^2 >= 0 and C2 - |x|^2 >= 0.},
}

