  annote  = {THE ROUND 4b GATE IS ANSWERED HERE, on pp1109-1110.
             WHAT THE EXPANSION IS. Following Hayes and Lighthill, and
             systematized by Landahl, piston theory is a double expansion in the
             thickness ratio delta and the inverse Mach number 1/M.
