             between local surface pressure and the local normal component of
             fluid velocity (Summary p1109). Fig. 1 p1110 tabulates the three
             successive forms: the SMALL-DISTURBANCE (first-order) relation,
             which is p - p_inf proportional to the downwash and hence AFFINE in
